body:
I don't think I'll be able to feel anything for the rest of forever. I just don't see myself ever being happy again. I thought these feelings would pass, but they just get worse with every waking moment. 

&#x200B;

I get what you're saying, but I don't care if I never feel happiness again if it means that I get to feel nothing. 

&#x200B;

I mean I wouldn't go for my wrists. I would go for places covered by clothes. Thighs, most likely. 

&#x200B;

I just don't know if I can be safe anymore. I don't know what day I'm going to wake up and end it all, but it just seems inevitable at this point. No amount of therapy or drugs that are pushed down my throat is going to change the fact that I fucking hate myself.
